      title: 'Technical Lemmas',
      summary: String.raw`Elementary inequalities used throughout the book: sufficient conditions for implicit sample-size requirements such as x ≥ a log x + b, conversions of sub-Gaussian tail bounds into bounds on expected deviations, the estimate Σ_{k≤d} C(m, k) ≤ (em/d)^d behind Sauer's lemma, and the comparison of cosh a with e^{a²/2} behind Massart's lemma.`,
